WEBVTT

00:00:00.236 --> 00:00:10.531
Serve another customer <b>without losing</b> a sale in progress

00:00:10.671 --> 00:00:17.156
Customer went back for something they forgot? <b>Save</b> the cart with their name

00:00:17.313 --> 00:00:27.930
Meanwhile, you serve the next one as usual

00:00:28.033 --> 00:00:31.820
When they come back, open your <b>saved carts</b>

00:00:31.894 --> 00:00:36.088
And their sale is right where you left it
